@startuml public-validate-seq
title Check a block
participant Block
participant Cap
participant Kind
participant Sig
participant Fee

Block -> Cap : does this fit the current room?
Cap --> Block : too heavy, refuse
Block -> Kind : named layout only
Kind --> Block : extra junk or wrong length, refuse
Block -> Sig : secp or Dilithium 44 or Dilithium 87
Sig --> Block : bad signature, refuse
Block -> Fee : at least floor(vsize / 12)
Fee --> Block : short the floor, refuse
@enduml
